{
  "dom_id": "step-t7856",
  "name": "Hyperbolic Cylinders With Alternative Central Axes",
  "problem": "For a hyperbolic cylinder whose base hyperbola $C$ has its vertex at the origin, the other four cases are as follows:\n\n- When $C$ is in the $xz$-plane, the axis of the hyperbolic cylinder is the $y$-axis.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14195198/assets/28f79c28aa6dfaa28b7b8ddd6d196bcb21db18411454c655a3365be52e8c6bc7.png)\n\n- When $C$ is in the $yz$-plane, the axis of the hyperbolic cylinder is the $x$-axis.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14195198/assets/5763cb9b167c2e1e9d17c9778bf569a0efafb4fe36f97e05e8e2173fb29fc998.png)",
